"use strict";
module.exports = /*#__PURE__*/JSON.parse('{"pages":[{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in tp\\"><div class=\\"urt\\">بے نصیب عشق</div><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><h1>Be-Naseeb Ishq</h1><p class=\\"sub\\">A Poetry Collection</p><p class=\\"sub\\">Roman Urdu</p><p class=\\"au\\">SAQUIB</p></div></div>","t":"Title","c":"Front matter"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2>Dedication</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><div class=\\"v c\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Un dilon ke naam,</span><span class=\\"l\\">jinhone kisi ko khamoshi se chaaha.</span></div><div class=\\"v c\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Un logon ke naam,</span><span class=\\"l\\">jinhone apni baat kehne se pehle</span><span class=\\"l\\">doosre ki khushi ka socha.</span></div><div class=\\"v c\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aur un sab ke naam,</span><span class=\\"l\\">jinhone kisi ko na paakar bhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">mohabbat karna bura nahi samjha.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">2</div></div>","t":"Dedication","c":"Front matter"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2>Preface</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p class=\\"lead\\">Har mohabbat ka anjaam milna nahi hota.</p><p>Kuch log hamari zindagi mein aate hain aur humein ek aisa ehsaas de jaate hain jise hum bohot der tak samajhne ki koshish karte rehte hain. Kabhi unki ek muskurahat hamare din ka sabse khoobsurat hissa ban jaati hai. Kabhi unka ek chhota sa jawaab humein poori raat sochne par majboor kar deta hai.</p><p>Be-Naseeb Ishq ek aise hi dil ki kahani hai—ek aisa dil jo kisi ko chahta hai, magar us chahat ka jawaab nahi paata. Yeh kahani kisi ko galat saabit karne ke liye nahi. Kyun ke har baar mohabbat adhoori reh jaaye, toh zaroori nahi ke koi bewafa ho. Kabhi kabhi do log bas ek jaisa mehsoos nahi karte.</p><p>Yeh kitaab un jazbaat ke naam hai jo keh nahi paaye, un khaton ke naam jo bheje nahi gaye, aur un umeedon ke naam jinhein chhodna aasaan nahi hota.</p><p>Agar in safhon mein tumhein apni kahani ka koi hissa nazar aaye, toh yaad rakhna: tumhari feelings ki qeemat is baat se tay nahi hoti ke saamne wale ne unka jawaab diya ya nahi.</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">3</div></div>","t":"Preface","c":"Front matter"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in toc\\"><h2>Contents</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"5\\" class=\\"part\\">PART I — Pehli Dafa — Jab Dil Ne Mehsoos Kiya</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"6\\" class=\\"poem\\">1. Woh Pehli Mulaqat</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"7\\" class=\\"poem\\">2. Tumhein Kya Khabar</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"8\\" class=\\"poem\\">3. Naam Tumhara</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"9\\" class=\\"poem\\">4. Chhoti Si Khushi</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"10\\" class=\\"poem\\">5. Pehla Khwaab</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"11\\" class=\\"inter\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"12\\" class=\\"part\\">PART II — Khamosh Iqraar — Jo Keh Na Saka</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"13\\" class=\\"poem\\">6. Ek Khat Tumhare Naam</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"14\\" class=\\"poem\\">7. Online The Tum</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"15\\" class=\\"poem\\">8. Bas Dost</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"16\\" class=\\"poem\\">9. Tumhara Haal</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"17\\" class=\\"poem\\">10. Woh Tasveer</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"18\\" class=\\"poem\\">11. Bheja Nahi</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"19\\" class=\\"poem\\">12. Shayad</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"20\\" class=\\"inter\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"21\\" class=\\"part\\">PART III — Hijr — Jab Faasla Sach Ban Gaya</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"22\\" class=\\"poem\\">13. Badal Gaya Kuch</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"23\\" class=\\"poem\\">14. Intezaar</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"24\\" class=\\"poem\\">15. Tumhari Duniya</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"25\\" class=\\"poem\\">16. Sach Ka Pehla Din</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"26\\" class=\\"poem\\">17. Adhoora Jawab</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"27\\" class=\\"poem\\">18. Khud Se Door</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"28\\" class=\\"poem\\">19. Aakhri Umeed</a></div><div class=\\"pn\\">4</div></div>","t":"Contents","c":"Front matter"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in toc\\"><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"29\\" class=\\"inter\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"30\\" class=\\"part\\">PART IV — Be-Naseeb Ishq — Adhoori Dastaan</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"31\\" class=\\"poem\\">20. Aakhri Khat</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"32\\" class=\\"poem\\">21. Woh Purane Din</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"33\\" class=\\"poem\\">22. Tumse Koi Shikayat Nahi</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"34\\" class=\\"poem\\">23. Agar Kabhi Yaad Aaun</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"35\\" class=\\"poem\\">24. Be-Naseeb Ishq</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"36\\" class=\\"poem\\">25. Khat Jo Bheja Nahi</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"37\\" class=\\"inter\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"38\\" class=\\"part\\">PART V — Rukhsat — Ab Main Khud Se Milunga</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"39\\" class=\\"poem\\">26. Ek Nayi Subah</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"40\\" class=\\"poem\\">27. Main Bhi Zaroori Hoon</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"41\\" class=\\"poem\\">28. Yaad Ab Bhi Aati Hai</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"42\\" class=\\"poem\\">29. Khud Ko Maaf Kiya</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"43\\" class=\\"poem\\">30. Rukhsat</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"44\\" class=\\"poem\\">31. Mere Naam</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"45\\" class=\\"inter\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</a><a href=\\"#\\" data-go=\\"46\\" class=\\"end\\">Musannif Ki Aakhri Baat</a></div><div class=\\"pn\\">5</div></div>","t":"Contents","c":"Front matter"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in part\\"><div class=\\"pt\\">PART I</div><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><div class=\\"ps\\">Pehli Dafa — Jab Dil Ne Mehsoos Kiya</div></div></div>","t":"PART I · Pehli Dafa — Jab Dil Ne Mehsoos Kiya","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>1. Woh Pehli Mulaqat</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Us din tumse milna koi khaas baat nahi thi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bas log mile the, baatein hui thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Magar pata nahi kyun,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ghar laut kar bhi tum yaad aaye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumne bas muskura kar dekha tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Maine us lamhe ko sambhaal liya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhare liye woh ek aam din tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere liye kahani ka pehla safha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mujhe tab kahan pata tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke ek chhoti si mulaqat</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dil mein itni jagah bana legi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch log zindagi mein aate hain,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur humein khabar bhi nahi hoti,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke hum unhein yaad rakhne lage hain.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">7</div></div>","t":"1. Woh Pehli Mulaqat","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>2. Tumhein Kya Khabar</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein kya khabar,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari ek muskurahat kya kar jaati thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main udaas hota,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tum saamne aa jaate,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur din halka sa ho jaata.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum do pal baat karte,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main der tak woh baat sochta.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum apni duniya mein masroof rehte,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main tumhari chhoti chhoti baaton mein</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni khushi dhoond leta.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein kya khabar,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke tumhara aam sa hona bhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere liye khaas ban gaya tha.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">8</div></div>","t":"2. Tumhein Kya Khabar","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>3. Naam Tumhara</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mujhe tumhara naam achha lagne laga,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Pata nahi kab aur kyun.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi aur ke munh se sunta,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh dil ek pal ko ruk sa jaata.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phone par naam nazar aata,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh chehre par muskurahat aa jaati.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main khud se kehta,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh bas ek naam hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Magar dil ko kaun samjhaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch naam sirf pukare nahi jaate,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dil mein bhi basa liye jaate hain.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">9</div></div>","t":"3. Naam Tumhara","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>4. Chhoti Si Khushi</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhara ek message,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere din ki sabse achhi baat hoti.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhara haal poochhna,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jaise kisi ne mujhe yaad kiya ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhara hans dena,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere chehre par bhi hansi le aata.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main in chhoti baaton ko</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bohot sambhaal kar rakhta tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tumhare liye kuch bhi nahi tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar mere liye woh lamhe</span><span class=\\"l\\">Poore din ki khushi the.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Dil ko kabhi kabhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bohot zyada nahi chahiye hota,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bas ek chhoti si wajah chahiye hoti hai</span><span class=\\"l\\">Muskuraane ke liye.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">10</div></div>","t":"4. Chhoti Si Khushi","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>5. Pehla Khwaab</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Ek din khayaal aaya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kaash tum bhi mujhe yaad karte.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kaash tum bhi kabhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere message ka intezaar karte.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kaash kisi shaam tum kehte,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj tumse baat karne ka dil tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Maine khwaab ko khwaab hi rakha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi se iska zikr nahi kiya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kyun ke umeed jitni pyari thi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Uske tootne ka darr bhi utna hi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir bhi dil ne chupke se</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ek chhoti si duniya bana li,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jahan tum the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur main tumhare kareeb tha.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">11</div></div>","t":"5. Pehla Khwaab","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2 class=\\"it\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p>Us waqt mujhe mohabbat ka matlab nahi pata tha. Bas itna jaanta tha ke tumse baat karke achha lagta hai. Tumhari ek muskurahat mere din ko halka kar deti thi, aur tumhara naam sun kar main be-wajah khush ho jaata tha.</p><p>Maine kabhi socha nahi tha ke yeh chhoti si khushi itni badi kahani ban jaayegi. Shayad har kahani isi tarah shuru hoti hai—bina kisi elaan ke, bina kisi waade ke, bas ek ehsaas ke saath.</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">12</div></div>","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","c":"Part I — Pehli Dafa"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in part\\"><div class=\\"pt\\">PART II</div><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><div class=\\"ps\\">Khamosh Iqraar — Jo Keh Na Saka</div></div></div>","t":"PART II · Khamosh Iqraar — Jo Keh Na Saka","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>6. Ek Khat Tumhare Naam</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj tumhare naam ek khat likha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Woh sab kehne ke liye</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jo saamne keh nahi paaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Likha ke tum achhe lagte ho,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari baatein yaad rehti hain.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Likha ke tumhare aane se</span><span class=\\"l\\">Din thoda behtar lagta hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir khat ko padha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur har lafz se darr lagne laga.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kahin tum door na ho jao,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kahin dosti bhi khatam na ho jaaye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Maine khat mod kar rakh diya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dil ki baat dil mein reh gayi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch iqraar kagaz par aa jaate hain,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar manzil tak nahi pahunchte.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">14</div></div>","t":"6. Ek Khat Tumhare Naam","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>7. Online The Tum</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Raat der tak phone haath mein tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tum online the, magar mere paas nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Socha message kar doon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Phir laga shayad pareshan karunga.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari roshni screen par thi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Meri umeed aankhon mein.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch der baad tum offline ho gaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur main wahi baitha raha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kitni ajeeb baat hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ek chhoti si hari batti</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi ko itni umeed de sakti hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum online the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar meri duniya se</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kitne door the.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">15</div></div>","t":"7. Online The Tum","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>8. Bas Dost</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Jab tumne kaha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">&quot;Hum bas dost hain,&quot;</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main muskura diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kaha, &quot;Haan, bilkul,&quot;</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jaise dil ne bhi haan keh di ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum baat karte rahe,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main apne chehre ko sambhaalta raha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhare liye sab saaf tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere liye us pal se</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har cheez mushkil ho gayi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main tumhari dosti khona nahi chahta tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Isliye apni mohabbat chhupa li.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Us din samjha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kabhi kabhi ek chhota sa jumla</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dil mein bohot lambi khamoshi chhod jaata hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">16</div></div>","t":"8. Bas Dost","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>9. Tumhara Haal</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main har roz poochhta,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tum kaise ho?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum jawab dete,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Theek hoon, tum sunao.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main kehta, main bhi theek hoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Chahe andar kuch theek na hota.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhara haal jaan kar</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mujhe sukoon milta tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Magar apna haal bataane se</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main hamesha ghabraata tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kya kehta tumse?</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke tumhari khushi mein khush hoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur tumhari doori mein udaas?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Isliye har baar wahi kaha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main bhi theek hoon.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">17</div></div>","t":"9. Tumhara Haal","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>10. Woh Tasveer</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj tumhari ek tasveer dekhi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tum bohot khush lag rahe the.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main kuch der use dekhta raha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Phir phone rakh diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Dil ne poocha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kya tumhari khushi mein meri jagah hai?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir khud hi jawab diya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har khushi mein mera hona zaroori nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari muskurahat achhi lagi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Chahe uski wajah main nahi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mohabbat shayad yeh bhi hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke kisi ko khush dekh kar</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni kami ka shor dheere kar do.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">18</div></div>","t":"10. Woh Tasveer","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>11. Bheja Nahi</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Message likha:</span><span class=\\"l\\">&quot;Mujhe tumse kuch kehna hai.&quot;</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir mita diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Likha:</span><span class=\\"l\\">&quot;Tum mere liye khaas ho.&quot;</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir mita diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aakhir mein sirf itna likha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">&quot;Khayaal rakhna.&quot;</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Woh bhi bheja nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phone band kar diya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar baat khatam nahi hui.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch alfaaz bhejne se pehle</span><span class=\\"l\\">Sau baar sochne padte hain,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur kuch alfaaz</span><span class=\\"l\\">Saari umar dil mein reh jaate hain.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">19</div></div>","t":"11. Bheja Nahi","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>12. Shayad</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tumhein bhi kabhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Meri yaad aati ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tum bhi kabhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere message ka intezaar karte ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tum keh nahi paate,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jaise main keh nahi paata.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Dil har roz naye shayad banata,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Taake umeed zinda rahe.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir ek din samajh aaya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad par zindagi nahi chalti.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Jo baat sach ho,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Woh kabhi na kabhi saamne aati hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aur jo sirf umeed ho,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Use haqeeqat samajhna</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dil ko thaka deta hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">20</div></div>","t":"12. Shayad","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2 class=\\"it\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p>Har raat lagta tha ke shayad ab keh dena chahiye. Shayad ek baar dil ki baat bata dene se bojh halka ho jaaye. Phir subah hoti, tumhara naam screen par nazar aata, aur main apne saare faisle bhool jaata.</p><p>Mujhe darr tha ke sach kehne se tum door ho jaoge. Main yeh nahi samajh paaya ke tumhare door jaane ke darr mein main pehle hi kitna akela ho chuka tha.</p><p>Har khamoshi mohabbat nahi hoti, aur har mohabbat ka izhaar zaroori nahi. Magar apne dil ko samajhna zaroori hai.</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">21</div></div>","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","c":"Part Ii — Khamosh Iqraar"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in part\\"><div class=\\"pt\\">PART III</div><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><div class=\\"ps\\">Hijr — Jab Faasla Sach Ban Gaya</div></div></div>","t":"PART III · Hijr — Jab Faasla Sach Ban Gaya","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>13. Badal Gaya Kuch</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Pehle tum khud baat kiya karte the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab mere message ka intezaar nahi karte.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Pehle meri chhoti si baat par hanste the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab meri baaton ko khaas nahi samajhte.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main sochta raha, shayad tum masroof ho,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad zindagi mein kuch pareshani ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir ek din samajh aaya mujhe,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Badla waqt nahi tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bas tumhari zaroorat badal gayi thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aur main ab bhi wahi tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jo tumhare ek &quot;kaise ho?&quot; par</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apna poora din achha kar leta tha.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">23</div></div>","t":"13. Badal Gaya Kuch","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>14. Intezaar</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mujhe tumhare aane ka intezaar tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein kahin aur jaane ki jaldi thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mere paas kehne ko bohot kuch tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhare paas sunne ka waqt nahi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main har aahat par phone dekhta raha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har notification mein tumhein dhoondta raha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum online aaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi aur se baat ki,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Phir chale gaye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aur main screen ko dekhta raha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jaise us par mera naseeb likha ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Intezaar sirf waqt nahi khaata,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kabhi kabhi insaan ko bhi kha jaata hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">24</div></div>","t":"14. Intezaar","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>15. Tumhari Duniya</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari duniya mein bohot log the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dost the, khushiyan thi, mulaqatein thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum hanste the, baatein karte the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari zindagi apni raftaar se chalti thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Meri duniya mein bhi log the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar meri har baat ke peeche tum the.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main doston ke saath baith kar bhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhare baare mein sochta tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari duniya mein main ek dost tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Meri duniya mein tum sab kuch.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumne kuch khoya hi nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur maine apna sukoon kho diya.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">25</div></div>","t":"15. Tumhari Duniya","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>16. Sach Ka Pehla Din</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Ek din maine khud se poocha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aakhir main chahta kya hoon?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari khushi?</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ya tumhari khushi mein apni jagah?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhare khwaabon mein bohot kuch tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bas mera naam nahi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Us din tumne mujhe chhoda nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kyun ke tum kabhi mere the hi nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Us din bas meri umeed ne</span><span class=\\"l\\">Pehli baar aankhein khol kar</span><span class=\\"l\\">Haqeeqat ko dekha.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">26</div></div>","t":"16. Sach Ka Pehla Din","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>17. Adhoora Jawab</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main tumse poochna chahta tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kya kabhi tumne mujhe us nazar se dekha?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kya kabhi meri baat yaad aayi?</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kya kabhi mere message ka intezaar kiya?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Magar phir darr laga.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Agar tumne keh diya, &quot;Nahi&quot;,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh main kis umeed ka sahara leta?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Isliye sawaal dil mein reh gaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur jawab main khud hi banata raha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Har sawaal ka jawab milna zaroori nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch jawaab bina kahe bhi mil jaate hain.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">27</div></div>","t":"17. Adhoora Jawab","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>18. Khud Se Door</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein paane ki khwahish mein</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main khud se door hota gaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari pasand yaad rahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni pasand bhoolta gaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhara mood samajhta raha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni udaasi chhupata raha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Ek din aaine mein dekha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Chehra mera hi tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar aankhon mein thakan thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mohabbat mein kisi ko chahna galat nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar khud ko khona bhi zaroori nahi.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">28</div></div>","t":"18. Khud Se Door","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>19. Aakhri Umeed</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Dil ne aakhri baar kaha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">&quot;Shayad kal sab theek ho jaaye.&quot;</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tum khud baat kar lo,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tumhein meri kami mehsoos ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Magar har subah wahi doori thi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har shaam wahi khamoshi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aakhir ek din maine umeed se poocha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">&quot;Tu kab tak mujhe rokegi?</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jis raaste par woh nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Us raaste par main kab tak chalunga?&quot;</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Umeed chup rahi.</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur maine uski khamoshi ko</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ek jawab samajh liya.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">29</div></div>","t":"19. Aakhri Umeed","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2 class=\\"it\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p>Us daur mein maine bohot kuch likha, magar bheja kuch nahi. Tumhari khamoshi mein apni marzi ke jawaab dhoondhne laga tha.</p><p>Tum bure nahi the. Tumne mujhse koi wada nahi kiya tha. Tumne mujhe woh khwaab dekhne ko nahi kaha tha jo maine khud apni aankhon mein saja liye.</p><p>Mohabbat mein kisi ko chahna galat nahi, lekin apne dard ko mohabbat ka saboot samajhna bhi zaroori nahi. Us din maine tumhein bhulana nahi seekha. Maine bas yeh seekhna shuru kiya ke tumhein yaad karte hue khud ko kaise sambhalna hai.</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">30</div></div>","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","c":"Part Iii — Hijr"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in part\\"><div class=\\"pt\\">PART IV</div><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><div class=\\"ps\\">Be-Naseeb Ishq — Adhoori Dastaan</div></div></div>","t":"PART IV · Be-Naseeb Ishq — Adhoori Dastaan","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>20. Aakhri Khat</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein ek aakhri khat likh raha hoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Koi shikayat nahi, bas dil ki baat likh raha hoon.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum meri zindagi mein aaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh mere liye kam nahi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum mere na ho sake,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Iska mujhe tumse gila nahi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Maine tumhari har chhoti baat sambhaal kar rakhi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad tumne sirf dosti dekhi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum meri kahani ka hissa rahe,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Chahe main tumhari kahani mein</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kabhi tha hi nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Khush rehna.</span><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh lafz likhna aasaan hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar dil ko samjhaane mein</span><span class=\\"l\\">Abhi thoda waqt lagega.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">32</div></div>","t":"20. Aakhri Khat","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>21. Woh Purane Din</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kabhi kabhi purane messages padhta hoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur khud par halka sa hans deta hoon.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Ek &quot;haha&quot; ko khushi samajhna,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ek &quot;take care&quot; ko apnapan samajhna.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumne kaha, &quot;Apna khayal rakhna,&quot;</span><span class=\\"l\\">Maine socha, tumhein meri fikr hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Har achha lafz ishq nahi hota,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har apnapan mohabbat nahi hota.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum apni jagah sachche the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main apni umeed mein kho gaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Yaadon ko mitaana mushkil hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar unka matlab badal sakta hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">33</div></div>","t":"21. Woh Purane Din","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>22. Tumse Koi Shikayat Nahi</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumse koi shikayat nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh baat main dil se kehta hoon.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumne mujhe mohabbat ka wada nahi diya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Maine hi khwaabon ko sach samajh liya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumne kabhi kaha nahi ke ruk jao,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main hi har baar laut aaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein kasoorwaar kaise kahoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jab apni umeed maine khud banaayi thi?</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum apni zindagi mein khush rehna,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Main apni zindagi phir se jeena seekhunga.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mohabbat thi, isliye tumhari khushi chaahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab khud se mohabbat karna bhi seekhunga.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">34</div></div>","t":"22. Tumse Koi Shikayat Nahi","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>23. Agar Kabhi Yaad Aaun</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Agar kabhi meri yaad aaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh khud ko pareshaan mat karna.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Woh din yaad aaye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jab humne saath hans kar baat ki thi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh bas ek pal muskura dena.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mujhe apni zindagi ka</span><span class=\\"l\\">Koi afsos mat samajhna.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mohabbat koi qarz nahi hoti</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jo har haal mein chukaana pade.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Maine tumhein apni marzi se chaha tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab tumhein azaad karna bhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mera apna faisla hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">35</div></div>","t":"23. Agar Kabhi Yaad Aaun","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>24. Be-Naseeb Ishq</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Shayad isi ko be-naseeb ishq kehte hain,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jahan dil milta hai, magar raaste nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Jahan ek shakhs khwaab bunta hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur doosra un khwaabon se anjaan rehta hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mera ishq adhoora tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar meri feelings adhoori nahi thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Har sachchi mohabbat ka</span><span class=\\"l\\">Dono taraf se hona zaroori nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kabhi ek dil hi kaafi hota hai</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ek poori kahani likhne ke liye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Lekin us kahani ko</span><span class=\\"l\\">Poore jeevan ka faisla bana lena,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh zaroori nahi.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">36</div></div>","t":"24. Be-Naseeb Ishq","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>25. Khat Jo Bheja Nahi</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Khat ko aaj aakhri baar padha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har lafz mein apna kal dekha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Phir dheere se use mod diya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jaise kisi khwaab ko aaraam diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Na use tum tak bheja,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Na uske tukde kiye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main tumhein bhoolne ka wada nahi karta,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kyun ke dil koi switch nahi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jo ek pal mein band ho jaaye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bas itna wada karta hoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke ab tumhari yaad mein</span><span class=\\"l\\">Khud ko saza nahi dunga.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Khat ab bhi mere paas hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar usmein band umeed</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj pehli baar azaad hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">37</div></div>","t":"25. Khat Jo Bheja Nahi","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2 class=\\"it\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p>Khat likhne ke baad bhi main der tak use dekhta raha. Dil chahta tha ke bhej doon. Magar phir maine khud se poocha—kya mujhe tumhara jawaab chahiye tha, ya main chahta tha ke tum mere dard ko samajh kar use kam kar do?</p><p>Tumhari feelings tumhari thi, meri feelings meri. Kisi ek ke dil mein mohabbat hona doosre par koi zimmedaari nahi daalta.</p><p>Tum meri kahani mein rahoge—ek yaad ki tarah, ek seekh ki tarah. Lekin meri kahani tum par khatam nahi hogi.</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">38</div></div>","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","c":"Part Iv — Be-Naseeb Ishq"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in part\\"><div class=\\"pt\\">PART V</div><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><div class=\\"ps\\">Rukhsat — Ab Main Khud Se Milunga</div></div></div>","t":"PART V · Rukhsat — Ab Main Khud Se Milunga","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>26. Ek Nayi Subah</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj subah aankh khuli,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh sab kuch pehle jaisa tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bas ek farq tha,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj maine uth kar</span><span class=\\"l\\">Sabse pehle phone nahi dekha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhari yaad aayi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar aaj maine us yaad se</span><span class=\\"l\\">Koi sawaal nahi kiya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bas use aane diya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur phir jaane diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Theek hona ek din mein sab badal jaana nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bas har din thoda sa</span><span class=\\"l\\">Khud ki taraf laut aana hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">40</div></div>","t":"26. Ek Nayi Subah","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>27. Main Bhi Zaroori Hoon</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bohot din tumhari khushi maangi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni khushi ka zikr bhool gaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein samajhne ki koshish mein</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni baat samajhna chhod diya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Meri hansi bhi qeemti hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mera sukoon bhi zaroori hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum achhe the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar tumse pehle bhi meri ek duniya thi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aur tumhare baad bhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Meri ek duniya rahegi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi ko chahne ke saath</span><span class=\\"l\\">Khud ko chahna bhi zaroori hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">41</div></div>","t":"27. Main Bhi Zaroori Hoon","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>28. Yaad Ab Bhi Aati Hai</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Sach kahoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Toh tum ab bhi yaad aate ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi gaane mein,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi raaste par,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi anjaan chehre ki muskurahat mein.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch log dil se utarte nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bas unki jagah badal jaati hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Pehle tum meri har dua mein the,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab kabhi kabhi ek yaad mein aate ho.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main jhooth nahi bolunga,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke sab kuch aasaan ho gaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bas itna hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke ab dard ke saath bhi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jeena seekh raha hoon.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">42</div></div>","t":"28. Yaad Ab Bhi Aati Hai","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>29. Khud Ko Maaf Kiya</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj maine khud ko maaf kiya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein itna chahne ke liye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bina kahe umeed rakhne ke liye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Bina waade intezaar karne ke liye.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Kisi ko sachche dil se chahna</span><span class=\\"l\\">Koi gunaah nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Bas apni saari khushi</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ek hi shakhs ke haath mein rakh dena</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere liye theek nahi tha.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Ab jo samajh aa raha hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Uske saath aage badhunga.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj maine khud ko maaf kiya,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aur pehli baar</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apne dil se narmi se baat ki.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">43</div></div>","t":"29. Khud Ko Maaf Kiya","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>30. Rukhsat</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj tumse aakhri baar</span><span class=\\"l\\">Kuch kehna chahta hoon.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Na tumhein rokna hai,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Na tumse kuch maangna hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tum jahan raho, khush raho.</span><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhare khwaab poore hon.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tumhein woh saath mile</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jiske saath tumhara dil khush rahe.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj tumhein alvida keh raha hoon,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Isliye nahi ke tum yaad nahi aaoge.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Balki isliye,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ke tumhari yaad ke saath</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab mujhe aage bhi jaana hai.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Main ab khud se milne jaa raha hoon.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">44</div></div>","t":"30. Rukhsat","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h3>31. Mere Naam</h3><div class=\\"orn s\\"></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh aakhri nazm tumhare liye nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Aaj apne naam likhta hoon.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Us dil ke naam,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Jo chup chaap sab seh gaya.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Aye mere dil,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Ab tu aaraam kar.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Har dastak par uthna zaroori nahi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Har chehre ko apna samajhna zaroori nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Tu phir se hasega,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Phir se naye khwaab dekhega.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Mohabbat mein apna dil dena,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Apni pehchaan nahi.</span></div><div class=\\"v\\"><span class=\\"l\\">Yeh kahani tum par shuru hui thi,</span><span class=\\"l\\">Magar iska aakhri safha</span><span class=\\"l\\">Mere naam hai.</span></div></div><div class=\\"pn\\">45</div></div>","t":"31. Mere Naam","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2 class=\\"it\\">Safhon Ke Darmiyan</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p>Theek hona hamesha kisi ko bhool jaana nahi hota. Kabhi kabhi theek hone ka matlab hota hai ke uski yaad aaye aur phir bhi tum apna din jee sako.</p><p>Maine apne guzre hue kal ko galti keh kar mitaana nahi chaaha. Woh main hi tha, jo sachche dil se mehsoos karta tha. Ab mujhe bas itna seekhna hai ke apne dil ki hifazat kaise karni hai.</p><p>Kisi aur ka naseeb na ban paana, apni zindagi se be-naseeb ho jaana nahi hota.</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">46</div></div>","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"},{"h":"<div class=\\"pg\\" data-fit=\\"1\\"><div class=\\"in\\"><h2 class=\\"\\">Musannif Ki Aakhri Baat</h2><div class=\\"orn\\"></div><p>Agar tumne bhi kabhi kisi ko khamoshi se chaaha hai, toh shayad is kitaab ke kuch safhon mein tumhein apna dil nazar aaya hoga.</p><p>Main yeh nahi kehta ke mohabbat karna chhod do. Main bas itna kehna chahta hoon ke mohabbat karte hue apni qeemat mat bhoolna. Kisi ka tumhein na chunna, tumhein kam qeemti nahi bana deta. Har mohabbat ka milna zaroori nahi, aur har bichhadna tumhari haar nahi hoti.</p><p>Kabhi kabhi zindagi ka sabse mushkil alvida kisi doosre ko nahi, apni us umeed ko kehna hota hai jo humein wahin roke rakhti hai jahan se humein aage badhna chahiye.</p><p>Agar tum abhi usi mod par ho, toh khud ko waqt dena. Har dard ka jawaab aaj milna zaroori nahi.</p><p>Kisi aur ka naseeb na ban paana, apni zindagi se be-naseeb ho jaana nahi hota.</p><p class=\\"sg\\">— Saquib</p><p class=\\"sg r\\">— Saquib</p></div><div class=\\"pn\\">47</div></div>","t":"Musannif Ki Aakhri Baat","c":"Part V — Rukhsat"}],"toc":[{"k":"part","t":"PART I — Pehli Dafa — Jab Dil Ne Mehsoos Kiya","p":5},{"k":"poem","t":"1. Woh Pehli Mulaqat","p":6},{"k":"poem","t":"2. Tumhein Kya Khabar","p":7},{"k":"poem","t":"3. Naam Tumhara","p":8},{"k":"poem","t":"4. Chhoti Si Khushi","p":9},{"k":"poem","t":"5. Pehla Khwaab","p":10},{"k":"inter","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","p":11},{"k":"part","t":"PART II — Khamosh Iqraar — Jo Keh Na Saka","p":12},{"k":"poem","t":"6. Ek Khat Tumhare Naam","p":13},{"k":"poem","t":"7. Online The Tum","p":14},{"k":"poem","t":"8. Bas Dost","p":15},{"k":"poem","t":"9. Tumhara Haal","p":16},{"k":"poem","t":"10. Woh Tasveer","p":17},{"k":"poem","t":"11. Bheja Nahi","p":18},{"k":"poem","t":"12. Shayad","p":19},{"k":"inter","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","p":20},{"k":"part","t":"PART III — Hijr — Jab Faasla Sach Ban Gaya","p":21},{"k":"poem","t":"13. Badal Gaya Kuch","p":22},{"k":"poem","t":"14. Intezaar","p":23},{"k":"poem","t":"15. Tumhari Duniya","p":24},{"k":"poem","t":"16. Sach Ka Pehla Din","p":25},{"k":"poem","t":"17. Adhoora Jawab","p":26},{"k":"poem","t":"18. Khud Se Door","p":27},{"k":"poem","t":"19. Aakhri Umeed","p":28},{"k":"inter","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","p":29},{"k":"part","t":"PART IV — Be-Naseeb Ishq — Adhoori Dastaan","p":30},{"k":"poem","t":"20. Aakhri Khat","p":31},{"k":"poem","t":"21. Woh Purane Din","p":32},{"k":"poem","t":"22. Tumse Koi Shikayat Nahi","p":33},{"k":"poem","t":"23. Agar Kabhi Yaad Aaun","p":34},{"k":"poem","t":"24. Be-Naseeb Ishq","p":35},{"k":"poem","t":"25. Khat Jo Bheja Nahi","p":36},{"k":"inter","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","p":37},{"k":"part","t":"PART V — Rukhsat — Ab Main Khud Se Milunga","p":38},{"k":"poem","t":"26. Ek Nayi Subah","p":39},{"k":"poem","t":"27. Main Bhi Zaroori Hoon","p":40},{"k":"poem","t":"28. Yaad Ab Bhi Aati Hai","p":41},{"k":"poem","t":"29. Khud Ko Maaf Kiya","p":42},{"k":"poem","t":"30. Rukhsat","p":43},{"k":"poem","t":"31. Mere Naam","p":44},{"k":"inter","t":"Safhon Ke Darmiyan","p":45},{"k":"end","t":"Musannif Ki Aakhri Baat","p":46}]}');

